ear me](https://www.magicbricks.com/resale-flats-near-me)\n\nTop Properties in Mumbai\n\n* [House for sale in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/independent-house-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Builder Floor in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/builder-floor-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Flats for sale in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n* [Resale Flats in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/resale-flats-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Plots in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/residential-plots-land-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Villas in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/villa-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Property in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Low Budget Flats in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/low-budget-flats-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Ready To Move Flats in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/ready-to-move-flats-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Penthouse in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/penthouse-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Agriculture Land for sale in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/agricultural-land-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Mumbai)\n\nView more\n\n1 BHK Flats in Malad West, Mumbai FAQs\n\n* ### Are there any low budget flat in Malad West?\n\n  Malad West has a plethora of [low-budget 1 BHK options](https://www.magicbricks.com/low-budget-flats-for-sale-in-malad-west-mumbai-pppfs) to choose from. You will find 25 affordable flats in Malad West matching your requirements.\n* ### How many ready to move 1 BHK Flats in Malad West?\n\n  Explore from over 725 1 BHK [ready to move flats in Malad West](https://www.magicbricks.com/ready-to-move-flats-in-malad-west-mumbai-pppfs).\n* ### How many 1 BHK resale Flats in Malad West?\n\n  Choose for 1 BHK [resale flats in Malad West](https://www.magicbricks.com/resale-flats-in-malad-west-mumbai-pppfs), both unfurnished and furnished. You can find great deals on as many as 204 resale flats in Malad West.","images":[]},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/krishna-disha-darshan-project-malad-west-mumbai/5474","title":"Krishna Disha Darshan Malad West | Latest Price, Floor Plans & Brochure","raw_content":"[![keystonerealestateadvisory.com](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/gallery/ks-logo.webp)](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n\nAll Categories\n\n* All Categories\n* Shops\n* Hotels\n* Restaurants\n* Bars\n* Events\n* Fitness\n\n\n\n1. [Home](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n2. [Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n3. [Western Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-western-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [Malad West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-malad-west-mumbai)\n5. Krishna Disha Darshan\n\n[![Krishna Disha Darshan Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/k7QpInhSVYlDUBYzyhIzbjrnVO07MTPZaBPOxBJN.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Krishna Disha Darshan\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n![Parking Type](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Parking Type\n\n0.09 Acres\n\n9 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nMarch 2025\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\nKrishna Disha Darshan is a new residential project in Malad, which offers thoughtfully designed 1 BHK and 2 BHK flats for sale in Mumbai location.\n\nStrategically located on Nadiyawala Colony, Roads No 2, Malad West, Maharashtra 400064, this Mumbai property offers excellent connectivity to Balajee Hospital, Atharva Institute Of Management Studies, Valnai Meeth Chowky Metro station, and other major locations.\n\nKrishna Developers designs homes with utmost care and planning of every corner. This property in Mumbai offers all the basic facilities and amenities for its residents. The Krishna Disha Darshan project is suitable for families and professionals who are planning to buy property with good connectivity.\n\nThe Krishna Disha Darshan Mumbai project is spread across 0.09 acres of land parcel and features a single residential tower, designed to offer comfortable living spaces with efficient layouts and proper ventilation.\n\n**Krishna Disha Darshan Project Details:**\n\n* Possession: March 2025\n* RERA Number: P51700046158\n\n**Configurations Available at Krishna Disha Darshan Mumbai:**\n\n* **1 BHK Carpet Area -** 410 Sq.Ft.\n* **2 BHK Carpet Area -** 600 Sq.Ft.\n\n**Lifestyle Amenities at Krishna Disha Darshan Malad:**\n\n* High-speed elevators\n* 24×7 security with CCTV surveillance\n* Power backup for common areas\n* Children’s play zone\n* Indoor games area\n* Landscaped garden\n\n**Krishna Disha Darshan Malad Location Highlights:**\n\n* Easy Access to Public Transport\n* Best Schools and Colleges Nearby\n* Markets at a Walkable Distance\n* Modern Amenities and Facilities are Within Reach\n\nLook no further than Krishna Disha Darshan Malad if you're looking to purchase real estate in Mumbai that has excellent connectivity, modern amenities, and thoughtfully planned layouts.\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nKrishna Disha Darshan brochure\n\n## Pricing of Krishna Disha Darshan\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [1 BHK Apartment](#tabs-3)\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n\n* [422 sqft](#tabs-21225)\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/